: start
00010011 00000000 10000000 11010010                                       : 0x078  movz x19, #0               accumulator = 0
00010100 00000000 10000000 11010010                                       : 0x07c  movz x20, #0               digits in current group = 0
00010101 00000000 10000000 11010010                                       : 0x080  movz x21, #0               not in a comment

: loop: read one byte into [sp]
